at was already generated and approved.\n\nNow let me write the L4 file. Let me be thorough and detailed.\n\nKey aspects for L4 Kernel调度:\n- Tile切分 (tile partitioning)\n- Memory hierarchy (global, shared, register, L1/L2 cache)\n- Instruction pipeline (instruction-level parallelism, warp scheduling)\n- Kernel fusion\n- Micro-operator concurrency (within a single kernel launch or across multiple kernel launches)\n- Stream/CUDA graph for kernel concurrency\n- Hardware architecture emphasis: SM structure, warp scheduler, tensor core, memory bandwidth, shared memory banking, register file pressure\n\nLet me construct each question with rich detail and keywords.","signature":"0092570d-74ba-4864-a9e9-2771a6c2ef27"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":16776,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":20224,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0eddd884-129b-4269-b7ce-8607609a6e24","uuid":"aa160704-336e-482e-838d-beed246d7967"}
