{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"d3b99aa0-962d-4c33-8d27-962ce55527f5","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture of the format. Both L1 and L6 follow the same pattern. Let me follow this format and construct the L4 question space.\n\nFor L4 (Kernel 调度), which covers:\n- 算子实现\n- Tile切分\n- 微算子并发\n- Memory Hierarchy\n- 指令流水线\n- 并发kernel\n\nI need to expand from the 4 preset questions to 6 questions, ensuring method/implementation/experiment environment coverage. Let me design the questions:\n\n**Q4.1** (方法类): Kernel 切分与调度策略 —— 在单GPU/NPU/加速器上，针对MoE、DiT、多模态、Video模型的单请求推理，kernel 如何切分（tile切分、wavefront tiling、persistent kernel等）和调度来支持多算子/微算子并发？\n\n**Q4.2** (方法类): 指令编排与Pipeline设计 —— 多算子/微算子并发的指令编排（instruction scheduling、warp scheduling、scoreboarding）和软件流水线（software pipelining）设计？如何利用指令级并行（ILP）和线程级并行（TLP）？\n\n**Q4.3** (方法类): Memory Hierarchy 与微算子并发 —— Memory Hierarchy（register file、shared memory、L1/L2 cache、HBM/global memory）如何影响多算子/微算子并发的 kernel 设计？数据复用策略、bank conflict避免、shared memory 划分？\n\n**Q4.4** (方法类): Tile 切分策略与硬件适配 —— 针对MoE（expert FFN tile）、DiT（attention tile + convolution tile）、多模态（跨模态融合 tile）、Video（时空 tile），tile size/shape 如何适配不同硬件体系结构（GPU SM、NPU 脉动阵列、加速器计算单元）以最大化并发？\n\n**Q4.5** (实现类): Kernel 调度框架/方法与实现 —— 有哪些 kernel 调度框架/方法（Triton、CUTLASS、TensorRT、TVM、XLA、CUDA Graph/Stream、ROCm HIP、CANN Ascend等）支持这些模型在多算子/微算子并发场景下的 kernel 生成与调度？\n\n**Q4.6** (实验环境类): 实现与实验环境 —— 这些 kernel 调度方法的实现细节和实验环境（硬件平台如H100/A100/昇腾910B/MI300X/TPU v5e、benchmark如GEMM/FlashAttention、关键指标如occupancy/MFU/TFLOPs/latency/power）？\n\nNow let me also think about the L4 coverage in detail and construct very specific, rich questions with hardware architecture emphasis.\n\nLet me write the file now.","signature":"d3b99aa0-962d-4c33-8d27-962ce55527f5"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":19853,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":20224,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":